---
import CharacterSummary from "$components/blocks/CharacterSummary.astro";
import Content from "$components/elements/text/Content.astro";
import NavItem from "$components/navigation/NavItem.astro";
import NavSection from "$components/navigation/NavSection.astro";
import ContentPage from "$layouts/ContentPage.astro";
import Infobox from "$components/elements/infobox/Infobox.astro";
import InfoboxField from "$components/elements/infobox/InfoboxField.astro";
import Date from "$components/elements/text/Date.astro";
import Paper from "$components/containers/Paper.astro";
import PaperTitle from "$components/elements/text/PaperTitle.astro";
import Gallery from "$components/elements/gallery/Gallery.astro";
import GalleryImage from "$components/elements/gallery/GalleryImage.astro";
import ArrowButton from "$components/elements/buttons/ArrowButton.astro";
import StickyNote from "$components/containers/StickyNote.astro";
---

<ContentPage title="Paperbark">
    <Fragment slot="navigation">
        <NavSection name="Navigation">
            <NavItem name="Home" href="/" />
            <NavItem name="OCs" href="/ocs" />
        </NavSection>
    </Fragment>

    <Fragment slot="contents">
        <NavSection name="On This Page">
            <NavItem name="Paperbark" href="#paperbark" />
            <NavItem name="Character" href="#character" />
            <NavItem name="Cutie Mark" href="#cutie-mark" />
            <NavItem name="History" href="#history" />
            <NavItem name="Gallery" href="#gallery" />
            <NavItem name="Pony Town Outfits" href="#pony-town-outfits" />
        </NavSection>
    </Fragment>

    <Fragment slot="main">
        <CharacterSummary
            name="Paperbark"
            image="/images/ocs/paperbark/profile.jpg"
            reactions={{ type: "auto", name: "ocs/paperbark" }}
        >
            <Fragment slot="info">
                <Infobox>
                    <InfoboxField label="Created">
                        <Date date="2024-06-24" />
                    </InfoboxField>
                    <InfoboxField label="Pronouns">They / Them</InfoboxField>
                    <InfoboxField label="Universe">My Little Pony: Friendship is Magic</InfoboxField>
                    <InfoboxField label="Species">Unicorn pony</InfoboxField>
                    <InfoboxField label="Age">Young adult</InfoboxField>
                    <InfoboxField label="Cutie mark">Bookmark</InfoboxField>
                </Infobox>
            </Fragment>
            <Fragment slot="description">
                <Content>
                    <div class="button-container">
                        <ArrowButton href="https://toyhou.se/39037018.paperbark">
                            View on Toyhouse
                        </ArrowButton>
                    </div>
                </Content>
            </Fragment>
        </CharacterSummary>
        <Paper>
            <PaperTitle el="h2" title="Character" />
            <Content>
                <p>
                    Paperbark is a gentle, reserved pony who loves to preserve memories for themself and other
                    ponies to revisit when they want to experience the special moments in their lives again.
                    They usually keep to themself, despite attending a lot of social gatherings, existing
                    mostly in the background and collecting artifacts for their scrapbooks of memories.
                </p>
                <p>
                    They are selectively mute, being almost silent in public and around large groups, though
                    occasionally make faint noises when they're especially happy or stressed out by something.
                    When they do talk, it is usually only with close friends or others they trust, and they
                    speak with a very soft, quiet voice which could easily be drowned out by background noise.
                </p>
                <p>
                    When spending time with friends, they prefer being in a quiet space with plenty of soft
                    furnishings and things to cuddle, like plushies. They are rather affectionate with others
                    they trust and enjoy hugs.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Paperbark often wears a long red scarf tied tightly around their neck as they find the
                    feeling of it comforting and helps them to stay calm while outside and around others.
                    Other wearables which put firm pressure against them also work, including inflatable
                    armbands, which they like to wear during the hot months or at the swimming pool when they
                    can't have their scarf.
                </p>
            </Content>
        </Paper>
        <Paper>
            <PaperTitle el="h2" title="Cutie Mark" />
            <Content>
                <p>
                    Paperbark's cutie mark is a symbol of a red bookmark, meant to represent how they mark
                    moments in time to be revisited later with their scrapbooks.
                </p>
                <p>
                    They received their cutie mark while taking a group photo with all of their friends at an
                    event. As they set the timer on the camera and got into frame, they realised just how
                    special the moment was and wanted to hold onto that feeling forever, then just as the
                    camera flashed their cutie mark appeared - the moment preserved forever in that photo and
                    surrounded by their friends.
                </p>
            </Content>
        </Paper>
        <Paper>
            <PaperTitle el="h2" title="History" />
            <Content>
                <p>
                    Paperbark was created as an OC in Pony Town on <Date date="2024-06-24" />. They initially
                    did not have much significance, but over time became a representation of the more
                    sentimental parts of my personality and the view of myself as a quiet introverted person.
                </p>
                <p>
                    It took two months for them to be given a proper name (originally just being a
                    placeholder), with their personality and name finally being decided in August 2024, though
                    they did not have a design for their cutie mark until almost a year later.
                </p>
            </Content>
        </Paper>
        <Paper>
            <PaperTitle el="h2" title="Gallery" />
            <Content>
                <StickyNote>
                    <Content>
                        <p>
                            I'm still working on this section, but for now you can check out all the art of
                            Paperbark over on Toyhouse!
                        </p>
                    </Content>
                </StickyNote>
                <div class="button-container">
                    <ArrowButton href="https://toyhou.se/39037018.paperbark/gallery">
                        Full gallery on Toyhouse
                    </ArrowButton>
                </div>
            </Content>
        </Paper>
        <Paper>
            <PaperTitle el="h2" title="Pony Town Outfits" />
            <Gallery>
                <GalleryImage src="/images/ocs/paperbark/outfits/base.png">Base</GalleryImage>
                <GalleryImage src="/images/ocs/paperbark/outfits/av.png">AV Tech</GalleryImage>
                <GalleryImage src="/images/ocs/paperbark/outfits/av-armbands.png">
                    AV Tech with inflatable armbands
                </GalleryImage>
                <GalleryImage src="/images/ocs/paperbark/outfits/swimming.png">Sopping wet</GalleryImage>
                <GalleryImage src="/images/ocs/paperbark/outfits/pirate.png">Pirate</GalleryImage>
                <GalleryImage src="/images/ocs/paperbark/outfits/pride-2025.png">Pride 2025</GalleryImage>
                <GalleryImage src="/images/ocs/paperbark/outfits/halloween-2025.png"
                    >Wizard (Halloween 2025)</GalleryImage
                >
                <GalleryImage src="/images/ocs/paperbark/outfits/winter-2025.png">Winter 2025</GalleryImage>
                <GalleryImage src="/images/ocs/paperbark/outfits/christmas-2025-alt.png"
                    >Christmas 2025</GalleryImage
                >
                <GalleryImage src="/images/ocs/paperbark/outfits/christmas-2025.png"
                    >Christmas 2025 (Alternate)</GalleryImage
                >
                <GalleryImage src="/images/ocs/paperbark/outfits/formal.png">Formal attire</GalleryImage>
            </Gallery>
        </Paper>
    </Fragment>
</ContentPage>
